+	/*
+	 * 0248: the control for the instrument, last so it cannot disturb any
+	 * of the readings above.
+	 *
+	 * CP_EVENT_WRITE to the page with no PTE is the same packet shape the
+	 * fence uses, aimed at the same page the descriptors point at. The fence
+	 * arriving is proof that this packet really performs a write through
+	 * bank 2; if it faults there and a shader store to that page did not,
+	 * then "no fault" meant "the store did not run". If it does not fault
+	 * either, then the bank never reports GPU data faults and 0247's
